    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main mission: survive and collect information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary mission: destroy every living thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Astragene company requires your talent to obtain information and terraform the planets of a remote solar system. Annihilate enemies and get endless upgrades. Some of them will have powerful elements that when combined will create destructive reactions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326940/extras/dcc9fcaadeebdefb2bb0d307c8933bc5.poster.avif?t=1745230331\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326940/extras/dcc9fcaadeebdefb2bb0d307c8933bc5.webm?t=1745230331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326940/extras/dcc9fcaadeebdefb2bb0d307c8933bc5.mp4?t=1745230331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326940/extras/900d5bb8294d38dd9e345a5959f23337.poster.avif?t=1745230331\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326940/extras/900d5bb8294d38dd9e345a5959f23337.webm?t=1745230331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326940/extras/900d5bb8294d38dd9e345a5959f23337.mp4?t=1745230331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326940/extras/ea136a3b97661738008275f5386a9273.poster.avif?t=1745230331\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea